@Api = http://localhost:5071

### Run an import
POST {{Api}}/api/import

### Recent import runs
GET {{Api}}/api/import/runs

### All transactions
GET {{Api}}/api/transactions

### Filter by source and status
GET {{Api}}/api/transactions?sourceSystem=Store Uptown&status=Revoked

### Audit history for one transaction (use an id from the list above)
GET {{Api}}/api/transactions/1/audit
